                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16563381" author="kuaw26" created="Tue, 31 Jul 2018 09:36:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed. Please test in branch ignite-9136.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16563451" author="pkonstantinov" created="Tue, 31 Jul 2018 10:39:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please hide the &apos;Activating...&apos;\&apos;Deactivating...&apos; label as well.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16563459" author="kuaw26" created="Tue, 31 Jul 2018 10:45:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed visibility of&#160; &quot;(De)Activating...&quot; label for old cluster.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16563538" author="kuaw26" created="Tue, 31 Jul 2018 11:59:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16564630" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 1 Aug 2018 02:10:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;One little error still exists - &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;deactivate a cluster&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;switch to cluster w\o persistent&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;switch back to the first cluster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;component prints &apos;Activating&apos; but should &apos;Deactivating&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16564691" author="kuaw26" created="Wed, 1 Aug 2018 03:47:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The root cause of last error is not connected to latest changes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The main reason - it is hard to detect whether cluster in activating or deactivating (no such state on cluster itself).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you wish, you could create separate issue to store &quot;inProgress&quot; state for each cluster, but this will work only if user will not refresh page in browser and not open different tab.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16564706" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 1 Aug 2018 04:12:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;A new issue created &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9150&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9150&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
